WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.072
You can lock your guardian, unlock it, and change your limit. Here's how, and why.

2
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.335
First, in Settings, under Guardian, you can lock it at any time. While it's locked, payments need your hardware wallet.

3
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.628
To unlock it, type the guardian's passphrase in the app, or on its web page. A wrong passphrase makes you wait before the next try.

4
00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:50.045
To raise your daily limit, type the new amount and approve on your hardware wallet. Lowering it works from your phone alone.

5
00:00:53.520 --> 00:01:01.584
You can even turn the limit off. Your hardware wallet has to approve it, and your alert contacts hear about it.

6
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:07.800
Next up: what to do if you ever lose your phone. Don't worry, it's covered.
